3.1 System Architecture
EduGenie consists of three major layers:
User → Frontend → FastAPI Backend → AI Modules → Response
The frontend collects the user's input. The FastAPI backend receives the request and sends it to the appropriate AI module. The generated result is then returned to the frontend.
3.2 AI Model Design
The project uses different models for different purposes.
Gemini
Gemini is used for:
Question answering
Summarization
Quiz generation
Learning paths
LaMini-Flan-T5-783M
LaMini-Flan-T5 is used for:
Concept explanation
The project document identifies these model responsibilities. EduGenie-Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant_Document.docx
